[CENTER][SIZE="6"][COLOR="Red"][B]How To Install in Recovery[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]
[COLOR="Magenta"][B]E410/11/15[/B][/COLOR]

[IMG]http://i1369.photobucket.com/albums/ag205/sindrome123/Unificado_zpsff29d48e.jpg[/IMG][/CENTER]

Requirements:
[LIST]
[*]LG L1 II bootloader unlocked (How to unlock [URL="http://xdaforums.com/optimus-l3-l5-l7-l9-ii/general/guide-how-to-unlocking-bootloader-lg-l1-t3240392"]here[/URL])
[*]Terminal Emulator
[*]recovery-L1II [URL="http://xdaforums.com/attachment.php?attachmentid=3530008&stc=1&d=1446590839"]here[/URL]
[/LIST]

steps:
[LIST]
[*]Download the recory-L1II ( link above)
[*]Download some recovery [URL="http://xdaforums.com/optimus-l3-l5-l7-l9-ii/development/rom-cyanogenmod-11-l1-ii-t3225607"]CWM[/URL] , [URL="http://xdaforums.com/optimus-l3-l5-l7-l9-ii/development/recovery-cwm-6-0-5-1-touch-lg-l1ii-t3240413"]CWM TOUCH[/URL],[URL="http://xdaforums.com/optimus-l3-l5-l7-l9-ii/development/recovery-philz-touch-t3240411"]Philz RECOVERY[/URL]
[*]Unpack zip the chosen recovery in  "internal memory" (/sdcard) They must have the "recovery.img" on this route
[*]Unpack "recory-L1II" in "internal memory" (/sdcard)
[*]Open the terminal and run these commands
[LIST=1]
[*]su
[*]cd sdcard
[*]sh recovery.sh
[/list]
[*]Done ;)
[/LIST]